22 I. "Parent" means a person who has legal custody of a minor child as a natural or adoptive
23 parent or a legal guardian, but such term shall not include a parent as to whom the parent-child
24 relationshiphasbeenterminatedbyjudicialdecreeorvoluntaryrelinquishment.
25 II. "Minor"or"minorchild"meansanunemancipatedpersonundertheageof18years.
